  {
    "id": "51",
    "bengali_name": "রামকিঙ্কর চক্রবর্তী",
    "english_name": "Ramkinkor Chakraborty",
    "dob": "",
    "doe": "",
    "photo": "",
    "details": "Ramkinkor was middle son of Gonganarayan. The sons of Ramkinkar were Yadunath and Akshay Kumar. The sons of Yadunath were Jivangopal and Harigopal. Jivan had three sons including Nandadulal. The son of Harigopal was Sachindra.",
    "father": "52",
    "mother": ""
  },
  {
    "id": "52",
    "bengali_name": "গঙ্গানারায়ণ চক্রবর্তী",
    "english_name": "Gonganarayan Chakraborty",
    "dob": "",
    "doe": "",
    "photo": "",
    "details": "Gonganarayan had three sons — the eldest Ramchandra Tarkalankar, the middle Ramkinkor, and the youngest Ramdhon. Ramchandra Tarkalankar was a nationally renowned scholar. Many students studied at his Tol (traditional school). He had three sons — Trailokyanath, Bhutnath, and Ashutosh. The sons of Trailokyanath were Bipin, Haridas, and Bankibihari. Bipin had four sons including Ramjiban. Haridas had three sons including Rampran. Bankibihari had four sons including Ramballabh. The sons of Bhutnath were Yogendra, Nagendra, and Devendra. Yogendra had three sons including Satacharan. Nagendra had three sons including Sushil. Devendra had two sons including Satanarayana. The sons of Ashutosh were Pramathanath, Dhirendra, and Hirendra. The son of Dhirendranath was Gorachand. This Dhirendranath obtained a PhD degree from Germany and married the granddaughter of Surendranath Bandyopadhyay. The middle Ramkinkor's legacy will be stated separately in his own node. The son of Ramdhon was Kailashchandra. The sons of Kailashchandra were Chaku, Satish, and Purna. Chaku had four sons including Pannalal. Satish had two sons including Harisadhan. Purna had six sons including Adhendhu.",
    "father": "53",
    "mother": ""
  },
